OL,3,GNEWSAGraves unearthed during town road
OL,4,Aimprovements
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo graves containing human remains
OL,7,Fhave been uncovered during the final
OL,8,Fphase of road improvement works.
OL,10,FDorset Council said the discovery was
OL,11,Fmade at Fairfield Road in Dorchester on
OL,12,F2 November as contractors excavated the
OL,13,Fpedestrianised section of the road.
OL,15,FIt was recorded by an archaeologist who
OL,16,Fwas on site due to previously
OL,17,Fidentified burials and other
OL,18,Farchaeological remains in this area.
OL,23,APub: 10-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
