OL,3,GNEWSAGraves unearthed during town road
OL,4,Aimprovements
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe local authority said the exposed
OL,7,Fremains had been "carefully covered and
OL,8,Fprotected, and work has been allowed to
OL,9,Fcontinue around them following
OL,10,Farchaeological advice".
